-- 0387_dbs_risk_assessments
-- Phil, 2026-10-05: Thistle asked for a DBS risk assessment, in two forms, for every company and
-- the Demo. Names, placement and questions agreed by popup:
--   DBS Pending Risk Assessment     working before the certificate arrives (DBS Adult First)
--   DBS Disclosure Risk Assessment  something shows on the certificate
-- The Regulator question is filled in from companies.regulator and decides which safeguards show:
-- England (CQC DBS guidance: Adult First, named supervisor, weekly service user contact for
-- domiciliary care) or Wales (CIW DBS guidance: no unsupervised work, direct support only alongside
-- an established staff member). Both forms are locked: they power the DBS card. No certificate
-- upload (DBS: keep certificate information no longer than needed, usually 6 months).
-- Applied to the becarecompliant Supabase project ONLY (ref bgrtcvyjuwopunpnudeu).

insert into public.form_templates (key, name, population, description, schema, version, status, locked_reason)
values
